  "scene": {
    "description": "Articulated double pendulum with a soft skinned arm: top rigid arm 0.25 m, second rigid arm 0.125 m, and a soft tetrahedral rod 0.10 m (shortened to avoid ground contact) attached to the second arm via constrained nodes (SoftSkinnedActorParams.softAttachLinks). The soft material is made softer (E=1.5e4 Pa, density 500) to show large deformation. The soft is a collidee: a ball resting on the ground is struck by the swinging soft, while the per-link box colliders remain disabled. Tutorial scene for soft-skinned articulations."
